      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "1. I don't know how much control VRChat has with the internet in general, maybe they can do something, maybe like. I guess I'll make a point to try USW and USE instances from my own connection. \n\n2. I am reasonably sure you can change the servers that instances are created on\n\nFive. labeling people with their ages might make them more targetted.",
