  "details": "current things vrchat needs to fix, before i explain note no issue listed are not a result of my PC or internet. these are vrchat issues many i know face, my PC is top of line and i have 4gigbit internet, \n\n1. connectivity between east and western servers - didnt used to make me and others ping ping jump from 39 - 497 and time me out.\n\n2. make instance creation not default to western.\n\n3. a vrchat update broke all games, items spawned in games no longer return to home locations at the end of games, this is a vrchat update that broke it not game makers.\n\n4. sdk issues - lagging or not clickable with out refreshing tabs sometimes , avatar id's not writing correctly - i upload pc and quest avatars and items break on quest alot, but there not broken in unity after a reupload with new ID everything is fine. - i use companion and keep updated.\n\n5. age verification shouldn't need vrc plus, also if younger then 18 that real age should be displayed - this is and opinion.\n\n6. let us upload items like the vrchat plus items - ok if this is a vrchat plus feature its what we would want to pay for we have been waiting for this as avatar items are often to big for quest avatar uploads this would fix that.",
